004300
004400 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
004500     05  MSG-TEXT.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1        PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
               10  FILLER                  PIC X(67) VALUE SPACES.
004600     05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
004700     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
004800
005200 01  FIELD-NUMBER         PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 1.
